<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Pharma Vision.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Pharma Vision.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on bearer sharesof Pharma Vision 2000 AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    850 CHF		   PREMIUM	13.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.62 CHF		  GEARING	10.1 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 01.JUL.97-18.SEP.98   PAYDATE	26.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  820 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
